note apps/omega-fhe/fhe_rlwe.om
note Wave 5 Alien Breakthrough: Pure Seeded-OM-2 Exact-Integer NTT Ring-LWE / Leveled BFV
note Homomorphic Evaluator (Z_q[X]/(X^N+1), ZERO floats, OMFHE1 SHA-256 + Ed25519 container).
note
note Compose after:
note   si/directives/om2.om
note   seed/ng/sha256.om
note   protocol/omnet/om/sha512/sha512.om
note   protocol/omnet/om/ed25519/ed25519.om
note   protocol/uor-gpu/ed_sign.om
note
note Zero C, zero Python, zero Rust, zero gcc, zero floats, zero GPU device writes (hw_writes=0).

